220	     * hex characters HASH8 of SHA-256 over the normalized telephone concatenated with
221	     * the last name, and a single Luhn check digit CHK computed over the digits of
222	     * {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8>} (e.g. {@code NSW26A1B2C3D45}). Assigned at creation
223	     * time and de-duplicated by appending {@code -<n>} on collision. The single source
