236	     * memberId} base {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>}: a 1-char Luhn CHK, an 8-char HASH8
237	     * and a 2-char FY, with the REGION filling the remainder. The single place that
238	     * describes the memberId layout for the getters that carve segments back out of it
239	     * (the construction counterpart lives in {@code AssignMemberId}).
